{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51220","headline":"五言诗 · 缺名","name":"五言诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（原爲长篇连续不断。\n刘复云：「卷残，抄出者共五十二首。\n」现选录十首。\n〖张锡厚《王梵志诗校辑》卷五云与伯三四一八卷爲同一系统的敦煌遗书尚有伯三七二四、斯六○三二、苏二八五二等三卷。\n今即据其所录校补。\n此组诗作者，张锡厚推测亦应爲王梵志，但尚缺明确的证据。\n〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}